40-L40","doc":"The dagger is contravariant: (g∘f)† = f†∘g†. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.compositionRule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.compositionRule","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/dagger-su2.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Composition reversal code: 1 encodes (g∘f)† = f†∘g† (single reversal). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.involutive","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/dagger-su2.lean#L36-L36","doc":"The dagger is involutive: f†† = f, i.e. †² = id. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.daggerOrder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.daggerOrder","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/dagger-su2.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Order of the dagger involution (†^n = id). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.invariant_ip_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.invariant_ip_unique","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/dagger-su2.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Each V_j has a unique SU(2)-invariant inner product (up to scalar). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.numInvariantForms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Examples.SU2DaggerData.numInvariantForms","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18d